%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#2b6cb0'}}}%%
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> L0: New Failure

    state "Level 0\nDiagnosis Only" as L0
    state "Level 1\nSafe Retry" as L1
    state "Level 2\nNon-destructive Recovery" as L2
    state "Level 3\nPropose Modification" as L3
    state "Level 4\nHuman-Approved Change" as L4
    state "Level 5\nRestricted Autonomous" as L5
    state "Human Approval Required" as HITL
    state "Escalated to Human" as ESC
    state "Successfully Resolved" as OK

    L0 --> L1: Policy allows retry
    L1 --> L2: Non-destructive action permitted
    L2 --> L3: Modification needed
    L3 --> HITL: Always
    L4 --> HITL: Always
    L5 --> HITL: Pre-approved scenarios only

    L0 --> ESC: Low confidence
    L1 --> ESC: Max retries reached
    L2 --> ESC: Validation failed
    HITL --> L3: Approved (propose)
    HITL --> L4: Approved (apply)
    HITL --> ESC: Rejected

    L1 --> OK: Retry validated
    L2 --> OK: Recovery validated
    L5 --> OK: Change validated

    OK --> [*]
    ESC --> [*]

    note right of L0
        No side effects.
        Pure investigation + RCA.
    end note

    note right of L2
        Session refresh,
        test data re-fetch,
        cache clear.
        Still fully reversible.
    end note

    note right of L5
        Only for explicitly
        approved low-risk
        scenarios defined
        in policy.
    end note
